==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|ru|en}} {{term|sc=Cyrl|космонавт|tr=kosmonávt|lang=ru}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|κόσμος|tr=kosmos|lang=grc||universe}} + {{term|ναύτης|tr=nautēs|lang=grc||sailor}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[astronaut]], especially a [[Russian]] or [[Soviet]] one.

